  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add jasmine rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil. Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 12 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 12 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-655fd1f2cdfd1895a62c3150-5afc0bb4.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice carrot into half-moons. Trim and halve green beans.\n• Cut tofu into 1cm cubes. In a medium bowl, combine tofu, 1/2 the Malaysian spice blend (add less if you're sensitive to heat!) and a drizzle of olive oil. Season with salt and pepper and toss to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-655fd1f2cdfd1895a62c3150-08203138.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook tofu, turning, until browned, 3-4 mins. Transfer to a bowl.\n• Wipe out frying pan then return to medium-high heat. Add carrot, beans and a splash of water. Stir-fry until softened, 3-4 mins. Stir in remaining garlic, ginger paste and remaining spice with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook until fragrant, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-655fd1f2cdfd1895a62c3150-0836cc5f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return tofu to pan. Add coconut milk, the soy sauce and brown sugar and stir until well combined.\n• Simmer until reduced slightly, 2-3 mins. Season to taste.\n• Divide rice between bowls and top with tofu curry. Sprinkle with torn coriander to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-655fd1f2cdfd1895a62c3150-8086c461.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
